LISA SB-probe-2fence
Scopes=(sys (gpu (cta 0) (cta 1)))
"D14(c): the INERT two-fence probe. TWO system-scope fences per proc, SB shape. Release/acquire fences carry no rf edge here, so nothing orders W->R: Allowed, and that is the model's answer, not an omission."
{
}
 P0                  | P1                  ;
 w[relaxed,sys] x 1  | w[relaxed,sys] y 1  ;
 f[release,sys]      | f[release,sys]      ;
 f[acquire,sys]      | f[acquire,sys]      ;
 r[relaxed,sys] r0 y | r[relaxed,sys] r0 x ;

scopes: (sys (gpu (cta 0) (cta 1)))
exists (0:r0=0 /\ 1:r0=0)
